<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Smith Barney cuts ICT.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Smith Barney cuts ICT.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney cut ICT Group to neutral from buy, a Smith Barney source said.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Alison Folino cut her earnings estimates on the company as well, her office said. The new estimates would be published later Friday, the analyst's office said.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
